    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d224">

                <pb facs="0356" n="271" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg271"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.00/a / 14</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Leavell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-04-30"><hi rendition="#italic">April 30,
                            1918</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received May
                        11.</hi>]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 506</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit to the
                    Department, in compliance with its circular mail instruction of May 28th,
                        1917,<anchor n="5" xml:id="d224-f1"/> the following brief report upon
                    Guatemalan affairs:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <p>(2) The National Legislative Assembly, as a result of the discussion of a foreign
                    loan, issued a decree (attached hereto, together with translation) authorizing
                    the establishment of a National Bank in Guatemala City. Article four of this
                    decree might be interpreted as authorization to open negotiations for a foreign
                    loan.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. Hayne Leavell</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d224-a1.xml" xpointer="d224-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
